1
00:00:00,436 --> 00:00:03,236
(Sheldon:)Internet info-tainment show.

2
00:00:03,239 --> 00:00:05,639
(Amy:)Take that, glass ceiling.

3
00:00:07,543 --> 00:00:11,483
(Sheldon:)And if I may get serious
for a moment,

4
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:15,420
(Sheldon:)hosting this show has been...

5
00:00:15,417 --> 00:00:17,517
(Sheldon:)one crazy ride.

6
00:00:18,954 --> 00:00:21,454
(Sheldon:)With all its ups and downs,

7
00:00:21,457 --> 00:00:24,287
(Sheldon:)I wouldn't give it up
for the world.

8
00:00:25,761 --> 00:00:27,831
(Sheldon:)Except for now,
when I'm giving it up.

9
00:00:31,167 --> 00:00:33,597
(Sheldon:)Before I sign off, I'd, uh...

10
00:00:33,602 --> 00:00:37,842
(Sheldon:)I'd like to share with you all
one last use for a white flag.

11
00:00:39,608 --> 00:00:41,838
(voice breaking):
It's good for times like this.

12
00:00:43,412 --> 00:00:44,642
(sniffles)

13
00:00:44,647 --> 00:00:46,817
(Sheldon:)Good night.

14
00:00:46,816 --> 00:00:47,886
(Dan:)Cut.

15
00:00:49,852 --> 00:00:52,322
(Sheldon:)Sheldon...

16
00:00:52,321 --> 00:00:54,521
(Amy:)that was beautiful.

17
00:00:54,523 --> 00:00:55,753
(Sheldon:)If you didn't press record...

18
00:00:55,758 --> 00:01:01,018
I pressed it!

